flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[/Enter credentials/]
 B --> C{Valid, enabled and unlocked?}
 C -- No --> I[/Login error/]
 I --> B
 C -- Yes --> D{Role allows page?}
 D -- No --> J[/Redirect allowed page/]
 J --> E[Module action]
 D -- Yes --> E
 E --> F[(Browser localStorage)]
 F --> G[/Refresh UI and result/]
 G --> H([Continue or logout])
